
# Wireless Crafting Terminal

>  Akin To A Bag Of Holding

---
So your storage is &awireless&r, but how do you &aaccess the contents when you're away&r? You'll need to &6craft&r a &bResonant Aperture&r, of course.

When you craft the &bResonant Aperture&r, it will start &aunattuned&r. &aTo attune it to your nexus&r you must &6insert it into a&r &bGuardian Ward&r.
{image:cottagewitch:textures/quest_images/ae2_guardian_ward_wireless.png width:250 height:250 align:1}
After you've &aattuned&r your &bResonant Aperture&r, you must be within range of a &bAetheric Beacon&r for it to work. With no upgrades, this is &dlimited to 16 blocks&r.

You can gain &ainfinite, cross dimensional access&r by creating a &bPlanar Bridge Card&r and a &bLinked Entangled Aetheric Fragment&r to upgrade your &bResonant Aperture&r with &a(see the next quests)&r.

Over time and with use, the &bResonant Aperture&r may &alose resonance&r, and if this occurs, you can &6place it in a &bCharging Gadget&r to fill it back up with &aresonance&r.
            